						<p class="mt-6 font-mono text-xs uppercase leading-5 tracking-[0.1em]"><span class="font-medium">Focus /</span> React, TypeScript, Go, UX/UI, DevOps</p>
					</div>
				</article>

				<article class="grid gap-6 border-b border-border py-12 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(11rem,0.7fr)_minmax(0,1.3fr)] md:px-3">
					<p class="font-mono text-sm tracking-[0.08em]">05.</p>
					<aside class="text-xs uppercase leading-5 tracking-[0.12em]">
