						<p class="mt-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.1em] opacity-65">3 mos</p>
						<p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6">I worked on smaller React projects, primarily with a designer to improve clients' online presence and UX/UI.</p>
						<p class="mt-6 font-mono text-xs uppercase leading-5 tracking-[0.1em]"><span class="font-medium">Focus /</span> React, TypeScript, problem solving, UX/UI</p>
					</div>
				</article>

				<article class="grid gap-6 border-b border-border py-12 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(11rem,0.7fr)_minmax(0,1.3fr)] md:px-3">
					<p class="font-mono text-sm tracking-[0.08em]">06.</p>
					<aside class="text-xs uppercase leading-5 tracking-[0.12em]">
						<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center border border-foreground font-mono">E</span>
						<p class="mt-5 font-semibold">Ennova</p>
						<p class="mt-1 opacity-65">Copenhagen Metropolitan Area</p>
						<p class="mt-1 font-mono opacity-65">Aug 2016 - Dec 2016</p>
					</aside>
					<div>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3 border-b border-border pb-4">
							<h3 class="cobalt-row-title">Praktikant</h3>
							<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em]">Internship</p>
						</div>
						<p class="mt-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.1em] opacity-65">5 mos</p>
